## **8.4.9.3 Binding Connectors As Usages** 

A `BindingConnectorAsUsage` is a kind of `ConnectorAsUsage` and a kind of KerML `BindingConnector` . As such, all the general semantic constraints for a `Usage` (see 8.4.2 ) and a `BindingConnector` (see [KerML, 8.4.4.6.2]) also apply to a `BindingConnectorAsUsage` . In particular, the 

