**417** 

`FlowDefinition` , the `FlowDefinition` can specialize _`Flows::Flow`_ (see 9.2.9.2.1 ), which is a _`Message`_ that also subclassifies the kernel `Interaction` _`FlowTransfer`_ (see [KerML, 9.2.7]). 

```
partdefPspecializesParts::Part {
portp1 : PdsubsetsParts::Part::ownedPorts;
}
partdefQspecializesParts::Part {
portp2 : ~PdsubsetsParts::Part::ownedPorts;
}
flowdefF2specializesFlows::Flow {
itemi : IredefinesFlows::Flow::payload;
