## **A.10 Verification** 

The simple verification case _`massTests`_ is a usage of the verification case definition _`MassTest`_ . The verification objective is to verify the _`vehicleMassRequirement`_ . The subject of the verification case is _`vehicle_b`_ . The verification case includes actions to _`weighVehicle`_ and _`evaluatePassFail`_ . 

The _`massVerificationSystem`_ performs the _`massTests`_ . It is composed of an _`operator`_ and a _`scale`_ . The _`scale`_ performs the action to _`weighVehicle` ,_ and the _`operator`_ performs the action to _`evaluatePassFail`_ . The verification case returns a verdict of _`pass`_ or _`fail`_ based on whether the measured mass satisfies the mass requirement. 

